            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Cranach Catalog Finder 1.0.3

This release makes the everyday catalog workflow faster and puts the desktop
controls where the work actually happens:

- a new five-tab workspace for Clients, Packages, Home, Catalog, and Settings
- live search results that filter while you type, with selected products moving
  into a persistent package panel on the right
- a clearer Google-like home view using the Cranach wordmark and a focused search
  experience
- browser-visible Check for Updates and Quit Cranach controls under Settings;
  Quit also closes the local catalog service safely
- build-aware browser URLs and no-cache frontend responses so a newly installed
  update cannot leave an older interface open

Visual proposals, sales quotations, catalog-page packages, saved client work,
catalog corrections, and retained downloads continue to work with the existing
catalog data. This application-only update does not replace reviewed content.
]]></description>
